{"meta":{"id":"tt39943756","type":"series","name":"Campus Drivers","imdb_id":"tt39943756","description":"Loïs llega a Belrose con Max, el amor de su vida. Lane, el creador de la popular aplicación Campus Drivers, es famoso por su falta de apego. Sus caminos no estaban destinados a entrelazarse, pero hay encuentros que cambian todo y reabren viejas heridas. Cuando el amor llega inesperadamente, las certezas desaparecen.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt39943756.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oaWJm4brEMSWBmQIB73DFxsU683.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yIZq5hr4ztF5ntlGv1QsgwgvBfT.png","genres":["Drama"],"releaseInfo":"2026-","released":"2026-11-06T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Returning Series","imdbRating":"7.3","country":"France, Belgium","cast":["Carmen Kassovitz","Baptiste Masseline","Esteban Vial","Félix Nebel","Madior Fall","Cassandra Cano","Eloïse Rey","Prune Pauchet","Enzo Lorente","Paolo Luka Noé","Louna Balavoine","Eva Hatik","Laetitia Rosier","Oumar Diaw","Annick Roux","Sylvie Granotier","Stéphane Coulon","Franck Libert","Alice Varela","Vadim Agid","Nadia Hamdi","Lola Letarouilly","Nathalie Besançon","Hugo Markowski","Tiziano Nicotra","Gabin Visona","Antoine Simony","Régine Poissonnier","Tom Brault","Kei Carasena"],"director":["Tom Goris","Vianney Lebasque"],"writer":["Thomas Boullé","C.S. Quill"],"trailers":[{"source":"xybsbjGt1KA","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]","ytId":"xybsbjGt1KA","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"xybsbjGt1KA","title":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]"}],"links":[{"name":"7.3","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt39943756"},{"name":"Drama","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Drama"},{"name":"Carmen Kassovitz","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Carmen%20Kassovitz"},{"name":"Baptiste Masseline","category":"Cast","url":"str